293
00:16:21,939 --> 00:16:24,066
(EARL GROWLING)

294
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:26,360
What's up, man?
Hey, Earl. I'm, uh...

295
00:16:27,945 --> 00:16:29,822
I'm John, and I'm...
I'm here to feed you.

296
00:16:30,781 --> 00:16:33,242
- Just don't eat my bird.
